   "solution": "<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Not available</p><div class=\"source-solutions\" data-answer-source=\"solution_only\"><section><h4>Source solution 1 <small>(score: 0)</small></h4><a name=\"477386\"></a><div itemprop=\"text\"><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"media/ec/ec4cadcd5c150b213dfb.png\"></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;=BC'D'+A'C'D+AB'D</p><p>So Option A</p></div></section></div><p><a href=\"https://gateoverflow.in/477377\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Official discussion page</a></p>",
