   "natRange": null,
   "answerText": "C",
   "marks": {
    "pos": 2,
    "neg": 0.6667
   },
   "solution": "<p><strong>Answer:</strong> C</p><div class=\"source-solutions\" data-answer-source=\"inferred\"><section><h4>Source solution 1 <small>(score: 0)</small></h4><a name=\"495372\"></a><div itemprop=\"text\"><article tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"7cb2f619-fc13-4582-ba33-2f8cf200b800\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-4\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\"><p data-start=\"69\" data-end=\"221\">CORRECT ANSWER IS&nbsp; :- (<strong>C</strong>)</p><p data-start=\"69\" data-end=\"221\">K-map (rows AB = 00,01,11,10; cols CD = 00,01,11,10) mein ones at m1(0001), m2(0010), m9(1001), m11(1011). Don’t-cares at m0(0000), m8(1000), m10(1010).</p><p data-start=\"224\" data-end=\"314\">Badi group (A=1, B=0) → AB′AB'AB′ covers m8,m9,m10,m11 (uses don’t-cares to include m9,m11).</p><ul data-start=\"67\" data-end=\"606\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><li data-start=\"315\" data-end=\"508\"><p data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"399\">Remaining ones m1 and m2 can be covered by two 4-cell groups that use don’t-cares:</p><ul data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"508\"><li data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"453\"><p data-start=\"404\" data-end=\"453\">B′C′B'C'B′C′ (B=0,C=0) covers m0,m1,m8,m9 → gives m1,</p></li><li data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"508\"><p data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"508\">B′D′B'D'B′D′ (B=0,D=0) covers m0,m2,m8,m10 → gives m2.</p></li><li data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"508\"><p data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"508\">Combine: AB′+B′C′+B′D′AB' + B'C' + B'D'AB′+B′C′+B′D′ — same as option <strong data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"564\">C</strong>&nbsp;</p></li><li data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"508\"><p data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"508\">(order different: B′D′+AB′+B′C′B'D' + AB' + B'C'B′D′+AB′+B′C′).</p></li></ul></li></ul></article></div></section><section><h4>Source solution 2 <small>(score: 0)</small></h4><a name=\"535328\"></a><div itemprop=\"text\"><p>solved check out<img alt=\"\" src=\"media/eb/eb6dd5ed5ff877bdb7cf.jpg\"></p></div></section></div><p><a href=\"https://gateoverflow.in/477381\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Official discussion page</a></p>"
