   "solution": "<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Not available</p><div class=\"source-solutions\" data-answer-source=\"solution_only\"><section><h4>Source solution 1 <small>(score: 1)</small></h4><a name=\"477388\"></a><div itemprop=\"text\"><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height: 20.8px;\">$(P + \\bar{Q} + \\bar{R}) . (P + {Q} + R) . (P + Q +\\bar{R})$</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,geneva,sans-serif;\">$(P + \\bar{Q} + \\bar{R}) . (P +(Q+R)(Q+\\bar{R}))$</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height: 20.8px;\">$(P + \\bar{Q} + \\bar{R}) . (P + Q)$</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height: 20.8px;\">$(P + (\\bar{Q}+ \\bar{R})Q)$</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height: 20.8px; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">$P+Q \\bar{R}$</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,geneva,sans-serif;\">Hence,option(B)$P+Q \\bar{R}$ is the correct choice.</span></span></p></div></section></div><p><a href=\"https://gateoverflow.in/477370\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Official discussion page</a></p>",
