  {
   "n": 13,
   "type": "MCQ",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "",
   "html": "<p>Consider the following expression</p><p>$a\\bar d + \\bar a \\bar c + b\\bar cd$</p><p>Which of the following expressions does not correspond to the Karnaugh Map obtained for the given expression?</p>",
   "paragraph": null,
   "options": [
    {
     "key": "A",
     "html": "<p>$\\bar c \\bar d+ a\\bar d + ab\\bar c + \\bar a \\bar cd$</p>"
    },
    {
     "key": "B",
     "html": "<p>$\\bar a\\bar c + \\bar c\\bar d + a\\bar d + ab\\bar cd$</p>"
    },
    {
     "key": "C",
     "html": "<p>$\\bar a\\bar c + a\\bar d + ab\\bar c + \\bar cd$</p>"
    },
    {
     "key": "D",
     "html": "<p>$\\bar b\\bar c \\bar d + ac\\bar d + \\bar a \\bar c + ab\\bar c$</p>"
    }
   ],
   "answer": [
    "C"
   ],
   "natRange": null,
   "answerText": "C",
   "marks": {
    "pos": 2,
    "neg": 0.6667
   },
   "solution": "<p><strong>Answer:</strong> C</p><div class=\"source-solutions\" data-answer-source=\"inferred\"><section><h4>Source solution 1 <small>(score: 0)</small></h4><a name=\"532912\"></a><div itemprop=\"text\"><p>$ad'$&nbsp; [fill minterm in K-map in front for $a$ and $d'$ ]</p><p><img alt=\"\" height=\"230\" width=\"232\" src=\"media/d7/d70d5512dc728644ac46.jpg\"></p><p>Similarly, fill all minterms &nbsp;for $ad'+a'c' +bc'd$, resulting K-map will be:</p><p><img alt=\"\" height=\"258\" width=\"261\" src=\"media/fe/fed1539291936e5c1f19.jpg\"></p><p><strong>&nbsp;Option (a)</strong> $c'd'+ ad' + abc' + a'c'd$</p><p><img alt=\"\" height=\"249\" width=\"251\" src=\"media/62/623a49911121e36cc39c.jpg\"></p><p>is equivalent to given expression</p><p> </p><p>Option (<strong>b) </strong>$a'c' + c'd' + ad' + abc'd$</p><p><img alt=\"\" height=\"259\" width=\"262\" src=\"media/95/95f00c1925b03bcae8b6.jpg\"></p><p>is equivalent to given expression.</p><p> </p><p>Option (<strong>c)</strong> $a'c' + ad' + abc' + c'd$</p><p><img alt=\"\" height=\"259\" width=\"261\" src=\"media/7b/7ba4cd9b962f44c6c67a.jpg\"></p><p>is not equivalent to given expression.</p><p> </p><p><strong>Option (d)</strong>&nbsp;$b'c'd' + acd' + a'c' + abc'$</p><p><img alt=\"\" height=\"285\" width=\"288\" src=\"media/ff/ff814227c0306455712d.jpg\"></p><p>is equivalent to given expression.</p><p>So, answer is <strong>C.</strong></p></div></section><section><h4>Source solution 2 <small>(score: 0)</small></h4><a name=\"540242\"></a><div itemprop=\"text\"><p>We can do it without K-map this way too.&nbsp;<br><img alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"821\" src=\"media/07/0796fdef1ac32cecf927.jpg\"></p><p><img alt=\"\" width=\"1090\" height=\"838\" src=\"media/a4/a44529ccd129eedbe4ea.png\"></p></div></section></div><p><a href=\"https://gateoverflow.in/477369\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Official discussion page</a></p>"
  },
